  "selection_reason": "Changed W04 guard and guarded slot transport definitions are exercised on nine original loop/pattern sources, including variable decreases. Tests check integer boundary/failure order, false guards, assignedness, high physical bits, inactive payloads, original goal bindings and metadata/certificate mutations. The shared integer emitter extraction replays all three existing integer-data pins byte-for-byte (control-edge-candidates); unaffected integer runtime/checker evidence is retained. One added Std consumer requires the five inventory tests. Final candidate import/regeneration ran before promotion; copied files match those exact hashes, so identical runtime checks were not repeated. Construction extension resolves all ten missing index_update guards and binds four ownership failure names to exact checked source points. Re-ran only that changed source (3991 observations); the other eight sources regenerate to identical bytes in 0.90 seconds, preserving 9919 prior observations and checker acceptance. Two private helper visibility changes exactly reproduce the previous source when reversed. Inventory paths and checker sources are unchanged. A foreach_string negative case retains five unsupported guards and rejects removing pending metadata. Earlier basic/native string fixtures had no W04 loop/pattern graph and were corrected without changing production semantics. String/native sequence/Option failures now use original definitions in the same builder. Eight new captured sources add 19751 current observations partitioned explicitly below: seven contexts retain 17875 observations; the updated type case contributes 1876. The original nine control sources and 31 string/sequence/Option/reference contexts regenerate exactly; only new or changed edge certificates were rechecked. Reference adapters and simultaneous option/sequence native scopes still need dedicated loop coverage before full-unit acceptance.",
  "state_rule": "source_exit_to_edge_specific_target; node_entry_merge_pending",
  "review_correction": "before-incoming-point-fix/review-finding.json",
